Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eddie！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eddie，wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't move。Okay，listen to me。- Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whatever you do，don't lean forward。- What's this？What's…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's going on？- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。I want to play a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The devices on your heads are symbolic of the shackles that you place upon others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You recklessly loan people money，knowing their financial limitations，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,counting on repossessing more than they could ever pay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are predators，but today，you become the prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it is your own pound of flesh that I demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your fault！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The scale before you is your only path to freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，only one of you may pass，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the toll is the ultimate sacrifice，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,the sacrifice of flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before you are the instruments to exact this flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move with haste，though，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,for when the 60- second timer hits zero，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,the one who has given the most flesh will release their bindings，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,while the gears on your opponent's head will engage，piercing their skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who will offer the most flesh in order to save their life？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not dying for you，bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ask you，Special Agent Strahm，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,have you learned enough to trust me？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,For if you do not，this room will forever be your tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will never be heard from again，your body will never be found，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,and my legacy will become yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was a pre- existing condition，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,which you did not inform your insurance company of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，babe。Good。Listen，I am so，so sorry，but I can't make dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got to work late again。I have a meeting with my lawyer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,this will keep me busy for the rest of the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's your birthday，and I'll make it up to you。I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Uh，what were we talking about？- We're talking about your deposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,So worried about me，Debbie
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some small- time lawyer trying to squeeze us
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,is not going to get me to say anything I don't want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no doubt about that，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,but as lead counsel for this company，if you screw up，it comes down on my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what do you say we prep your deposition？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you remember dealing with a Mr。Harold Abbott？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,William，I have a Casey Patterson on Line One.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take another message，Addy，I'll get back to her this week
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sometime…Keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,When opposing counsel asks about Mr。Abbot，how will you respond？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am going to respond by saying：
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,As Senior Vice President of Membership and Claims，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,it is my job to review to review every terminated policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact，Mr。Abbot was sitting right where you are now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,when we discussed his appeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I…I just don't get it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been with this insurance company for over ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know，Harold，but unfortunately，when we reviewed your claim
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,we discovered that you failed to mention a previous condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What condition？There's no condition
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It says here you had oral surgery to remove a cyst from your jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is absurd！I have heart disease
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with some oral surgery that I had 30 years ago！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any type of oral surgery is going to leave scar tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scar tissue can lead to gum disease
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and as you well know，gum disease can cause heart disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？You're- You're a criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are goddamn criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've paid my monthly premium for ten years without so much as a cold
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,and now that I'm actually sick，you're gonna deny my coverage？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have a family！- Those are the rules，Harold！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，but your own actions have caused this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've just given me a death sentence，I mean，who's gonna cover me now？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just killed me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a family too，so I can empathize with his argument
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,But basically，the guy lied on his application
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Whoa，watch it，Will。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think he did that on purpose？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't my job to assess what his intentions were
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was my job to check the accuracy of his claim
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody thinks we're the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:11:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody mentions the millions of people we help every year
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,without inciden.Or the millions of dollars we donate to charity every year
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or all the free clinics we support
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Short answers，Will。Short answers。- Today in probate court，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,The assets for one of history's most notorious serial killers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,John Kramer，were distributed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were mainly in real estate holdings。But in my time researching…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,One more question：Who found the error on his application？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Dog Pen。They work as a team
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there's a discrepancy to be found in an application，the six of them will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，they're waiting for you in the conference room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How's it going today，people？- Great，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。E.，Found two application errors for a chronically ill client.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,This guy practically lives at his doctor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，this could probably save us nearly 200K over his lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Terminator strikes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looking good，Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who will offer the most flesh in order to save their life？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not dying for you，bitch！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on my way
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Feds who took over the crime scene are requesting you ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know you ever made it out from behind the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I make exceptions when fingerprints are found at a Jigsaw murder scene
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have a look
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We also got a right index off the scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Been IDed yet？- Yeah。They're Agent Strahm's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I learned he and Perez were being targeted by Jigsaw
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should have been more aware，but I didn't see this coming
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not from Peter Strahm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It was a shock to all of us。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we have something he doesn't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lindsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Detective Hoffman。- Perez.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was my call，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew that Jigsaw wasn't working alone，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,but until I knew for certain who was helping him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I couldn't guarantee her well- being
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So you let me think she was dead？- Well，I didn't know who I could trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What else have you been keeping from me？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We know that Agent Strahm knew the five people in the real estate scam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The victims in the traps that Erickson found
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How did he know？- Strahm and I investigated them after the house fire
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was arson。All five people were accountable
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,But after our lone witness went missing，no charges were ever filed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strahm couldn't let them get away，so he put them in a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,in which slaughtering each other was the only way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what are you telling me？He's a vigilante？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call him whatever you like，but he has to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd like to work together on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You led me to believe that she was dead，and you want to work with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we're offering full disclosure，detective
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,So from now on，everything we know，you know.Is that fair？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Detective Hoffman。How about a quick word？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pamela Jenkins，the resident Jigsaw sensation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just reporting the facts，Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that what you're doing？「John Kramer，conundrum of carnage.」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you'd like to make a statement on the record
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd be more than happy to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're twisting the facts to make a better story。It's irresponsible
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Nice catching up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know more about John Kramer than you might think
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somehow I doubt that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kramer left his wife a box in his will.Did you know that？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I did，maybe I didn't.How do you know it？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probate court。It's public record for those who know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。What do you really want？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jill Tuck。Help me get to her and I'll dial down on the sensationalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you remember how you were transported there？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how I got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just opened my eyes and…He did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who did this？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You didn't cut your own arm off？- I did。I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he made me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because what Eddie and I were doing was wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were…we were ruining people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wanted us to learn
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,And did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at my goddamn arm！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck am I supposed to learn from this？！Huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at my arm！What…What am I supposed to learn from this？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:17:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just breathe。- Look at me！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello Gillian！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's a good name，hon。- Wow，Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could have been Scarlet.But，no，has to be a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see if I can get all three of us in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Snuggle around here.Lean inside。There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There we are。- Hey，Gideon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's a little happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We love you，Son。We're waiting for you。- We love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're watching this，Jill，I'm long gone from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm leaving you a box today，and its contents are of grave importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello。I'm not in right now，but please leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Tuck，this is Pamela Jenkins calling，yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was hoping you can clear some things up for me about your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me buy you lunch or a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've found something interesting about John Kramer's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you there，Detective？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,By hearing this tape，some will likely assume this Is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You feel you now have control，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think you will walk away untested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are the Jigsaw pieces carved from previous victims
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the piece taken from the latest victim
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It looks like all the rest - Yeah，that's what we said，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.99,0:19:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,The skin abrasions，they're indicative of a knife of a partially serrated edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So？- So，all of the other cuts were made
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,with a near- perfect blade of surgical quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obviously，Strahm used a different knife than John Kramer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，but it got us curious，so we pulled the files to compare
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,That same knife was used on only one other victim
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That victim was Seth Baxter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man who killed your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're telling me that you can tell a different knife was used from a photo？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，but I can.I was the one who examined that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've examined every body of the Jigsaw Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.41,0:20:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tape from the latest victim was missing，so we're looking into the Seth Baxter tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why's that？- Well，if a different person cut the piece，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,then maybe a different person made the tape，too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Strahm？- Yeah，maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strahm's voice on the tape would be our smoking gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have that，we could go public with his involvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.23,0:20:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But that's not what the prescription… - I'm sick！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look at me！Look at me！- Jane，Jane，it's ok，allright？Relax
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see you here so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The game begins tonight。- Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because somebody knows about the box that shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who？- That's not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,All you need to know is that：from now on，I control all aspects of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not what John wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the envelopes。That's not a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,From now on，I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.I'm only carrying out John's final request.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，John's dead。And his work is almost done
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's this？- Unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.19,0:22:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I'm done，we no longer speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …forty-five minutes。- Yes，I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Please！Please。- But we have to wait for the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let my hand go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Methadone is only a masking agent。It doesn't heal; it just simply numbs the senses
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've found a better way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,These people，they will continue to hurt you，and let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're addicts，John。Recovery is a process.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe addiction is just a part of human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what about these people，Jill，who come here every day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,and use you？They bide their time.They're avoiding prison sentences
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're getting hooked on masking agents，Do you call that recovery？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.16,0:22:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Addiction is not simple，Jill！Wake up！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,These people have no respect for the lives that they're destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once you see death up close，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,then you know what the value of life is
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I brought proof that it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Amanda？- Hello，Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jill，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.46,0:23:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,you once told me that she was a lost soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,But here she stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.43,0:23:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's clean and whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she has a new appreciation for her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.23,0:24:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It works。It's real。He helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not alarmism and mystify
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there are signs that trouble is back
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.39,0:24:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even though the police believe that John Kramer AKA（as known as） Jigsaw is died
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,But this passed week a new sort cold game was discovered with grossly result
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Victims included anyone associate with
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,the life of John Kramer however remote
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.53,0:24:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The jigsaw killer maybe dead，but the murders continued
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hank，you still here？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't fucking move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！Oh，fuck！Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.01,0:26:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I'm gonna take care of you。Just… Where'd you get hit？You wearing a vest？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.30,0:26:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，William.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.81,0:26:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've probably been wondering when we would see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.73,0:26:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Today is that day。- No！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.15,0:26:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,For years，your probability formula has decided the fate of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The healthy have benefited
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.53,0:27:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,while the potentially sick have been unjustly rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，this formula does not take into account the human will to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,When faced with death，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,who should live versus who will live are two entirely separate things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.13,0:27:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today，your policy will be put to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.09,0:27:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are four straps around your limbs，and you have four tests you must complete，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,for if you don't，the straps on your arms and legs will detonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have 60 minutes to complete your tests and avoid this fate，starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are not alone in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.74,0:27:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just as you have taken loved ones away from their families，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you don't reach the end before the timer hits zero
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.62,0:27:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,you will never see your family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.05,0:28:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom？Mom！Mom。Mom，wake up！Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are we？- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.14,0:28:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.40,0:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.57,0:28:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here is your first test.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your health and military background puts you in the highest category of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.58,0:28:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，the same cannot be said for your adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.71,0:28:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,At only 52 years of age，this man has continued to smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,even though he has a history of high blood pressure and heart disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.01,0:28:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This demonstrates his appreciation of the blessings of his own life
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your game will focus on a simple element.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,From there，once this game begins，every time you take a breath，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.98,0:29:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,the clamps around your chest will close in and crush your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.49,0:29:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only way to escape is in the other's failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.53,0:29:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I ask you，when faced with death，who will survive？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.79,0:29:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live or die，William。Make your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuck you！！- Who the hell is that？！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.34,0:29:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold your breath
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck？Oh，Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.71,0:32:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please help us！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.35,0:32:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help us！Someone，please！Please！Help us！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.35,0:32:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody，please！Please！Please，somebody help！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anybody？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.90,0:32:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Live」。「Die」。What the fuck？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.78,0:32:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's connected to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.62,0:32:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「H- F」。What does that stand for？- Hydrofluoric acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This stuff will eat through human flesh within seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.68,0:32:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What should we do？- Pull the lever。You want to live，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:33:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about the timer？It has to mean something
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.02,0:33:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，I don't even know why we're here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.81,0:33:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're here because your father
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.41,0:33:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.74,0:34:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，this will only take a second.We can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.70,0:34:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can come to my door like this？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.04,0:34:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I found something you'll want to see
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.00,0:34:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where'd you get this？- It was at the location where John died.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.30,0:34:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Does it mean anything to you？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.93,0:34:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goodbye，Miss Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.64,0:34:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.71,0:35:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to thank you for sponsoring this party，William.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.13,0:35:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I know how much the clinic appreciates it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.67,0:35:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- John Kramer。- William Easton.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.21,0:35:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kramer？You're Jill's husband，right？- I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.84,0:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you。- Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.80,0:35:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like we're in a similar business，John.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.97,0:35:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah？How's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you try to predict people's behavior。So do I
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.44,0:35:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,People count on us for coverage，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.86,0:35:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we have to analyze each person for the probability of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.19,0:36:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How do you do that？- Well，it's a formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.03,0:36:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's pretty complicated，actually，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.74,0:36:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,but，in essence，it breaks down to monthly payments
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.28,0:36:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,multiplied by lifespan minus the probability of illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,and if its sum is positive，we consider coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.25,0:36:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who devised that formula？- Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.85,0:36:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，in a sense… you choose who lives or dies？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I，uh… No，I'd say I decide which people have the potential
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.97,0:36:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,to live long，healthy lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.89,0:36:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you're not taking into onsideration the most important human element of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.98,0:36:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which is what？- The will to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.15,0:36:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until a person is faced with death，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.57,0:36:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's impossible to tell whether the have what it takes to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.09,0:37:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.45,0:38:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，William.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.91,0:38:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standing on the platforms behind me are two of your colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，your file clerk。a young，healthy male with no living relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,The other，a middle- aged woman with a family history of diabetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.51,0:38:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,According to your policy，your secretary is older and weaker and
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.43,0:38:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,and therefore less worthy to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you know the loss that she will be to her family
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.40,0:38:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,while young Allen will disappear without a blip on the world's radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only one can exit this room，and the choice of whom falls upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.24,0:38:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must let go of the one to save the life of the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.08,0:38:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you can see，the choice is not so clear
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,when you are face to face with the people whose blood will stain your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.46,0:39:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.05,0:39:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！No！No，wait！I won't do this！I won't do this！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.65,0:39:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,William！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.40,0:39:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a business！My decisions aren't made this way！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.37,0:39:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I'm not going to do it！I'm not going to do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.99,0:39:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do it！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.25,0:39:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop it！！- Please…help me…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry。- No！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.99,0:40:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Thank you！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You try to find a way out of here，Addy。I have to keep going。Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.91,0:41:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if we put acid on the metal bars？It'll eat through the metal，won't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.83,0:41:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but how are we going to get it on the bars？With our hands？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.71,0:41:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you looking at？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.84,0:41:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder… The mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.26,0:42:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Who's behind the glass？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.68,0:42:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you want！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.90,0:42:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.23,0:42:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody help me，please.Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.75,0:42:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Pamela.You've sensationalized my life，
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.21,0:42:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,twisting the truth and exploiting my message for your own benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.66,0:43:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hoffman。- It's Erickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.16,0:43:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We found the Seth Baxter tape。- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.42,0:43:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But there was something else we wanted to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.34,0:43:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that？- Better to talk about it in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.22,0:43:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time- sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.32,0:43:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.66,0:43:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just down there。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.18,0:44:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,The device Timothy is strapped to is my personal favorite。I call it The Rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last- minute tweaks？Told you he'd fuck with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.57,0:44:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you switch the gear ratio，
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.20,0:44:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,you have to change the gear grease to match the increased friction.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.54,0:44:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stick to the heavy lifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.88,0:44:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need five- weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.30,0:44:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's in the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.55,0:44:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check with me next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.93,0:44:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many next times are there gonna be？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.76,0:44:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,However many there needs to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.57,0:45:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you like how brutality feels，Mark？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.24,0:45:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's be honest。You want him to suffer just as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.60,0:45:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So when's your test，detective？- I don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.73,0:45:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，yeah？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.07,0:45:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I don't take life for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're still dragging your knuckles on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.78,0:45:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know about life？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.00,0:45:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get used to me，'cause I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.63,0:46:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure about that？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.93,0:46:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Time is short.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.31,0:46:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.94,0:46:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now it's time to get Dr。Denlon from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.15,0:46:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'll take you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.47,0:46:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go。Be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.86,0:47:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why'd you come here？- John，stop
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.74,0:47:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't do this。- I promise you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.79,0:47:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,when all this is done
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.92,0:47:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I will provide a way out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish that time was now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it for？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,When the time's right，you'll know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.86,0:48:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.45,0:48:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came to talk to you，Will，because
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.50,0:48:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've found a treatment for my cancer that I think holds a lot of promise，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.55,0:48:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,but my requests for coverage
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,have all been turned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I was hoping that maybe if I came and explained it to you，
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.93,0:48:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,that you might be able to get that overturned for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.19,0:49:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，the buck stops here，John。Fire away。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a doctor in Norway
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.69,0:49:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got a thirty to forty percent success rate with gene therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,He injects what he calls suicide genes into cancerous tumor cells
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.83,0:49:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,then any inactive form of a toxic drug is administered and it…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.25,0:49:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I'm familiar with the therapy you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.59,0:49:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。And a new trial's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.71,0:49:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's looking for new patients，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.34,0:49:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and he seems to think that I'm the perfect candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.55,0:49:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，if your primary physician，Dr。Gordon，thought you were a suitable candidate，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- he would have pursued it。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.14,0:49:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Gordon is a specialist。You know，he's making money on his speciality.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.64,0:49:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's not a thinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.35,0:49:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，the man has his hand on the doorknob half the time that I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.48,0:49:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be straight with you。At your age and with the development of your cancer，
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.20,0:49:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's simply not feasible for Umbrella Health…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.03,0:49:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait，wait，wait。What's not feasible？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.03,0:50:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,By whose mathematical equation is this not feasible？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.00,0:50:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's policy，John。It's policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.21,0:50:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if you go outside the system to seek out this treatment，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.79,0:50:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,which has been deemed ineffective，you will be in breach of policy
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.84,0:50:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you will be dropped from coverage completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.02,0:50:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you know that in the Far East，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.98,0:50:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,people pay their doctors when they're healthy？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.69,0:50:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,When they're sick，they don't have to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.70,0:50:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，basically，they end up paying for what they want，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.45,0:50:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,not what they don't want.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got it all ass- backwards here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.54,0:50:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,These politicians，they say the same thing，over and over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Healthcare decisions should be made by doctors and their patients，
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.97,0:51:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「not by the government.」
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，now I know they're not made by doctors and their patients
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.89,0:51:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,or by the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.06,0:51:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're made by the fucking insurance companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.61,0:51:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Piranha.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,John，please.If you do this，you'll be on your own，
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.37,0:51:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the subsequent cost to you will be staggering.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me about money。I have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.75,0:51:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is about principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.75,0:51:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Will… this is my life we're talkin' about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.51,0:51:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You remember？- What about Jill's life？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.55,0:51:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's she going to be taken care of when you're gone？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.14,0:51:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You let me worry about Jill.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.64,0:51:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The type of cancer you have is malignant and inoperable.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,That rolled off your tongue real smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.56,0:51:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even if the treatment works，the cancer will return eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's an unwinnable battle。- That was even smoother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.15,0:52:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact，that was downright slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think it's the living that will have ultimate judgement over you，
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.08,0:52:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,because the dead will have no claim over your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.05,0:52:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you may be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.61,0:52:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.29,0:52:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，William.You have seen the flaws in your policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.62,0:52:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what you have not seen is the extent some people will go to
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.42,0:52:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,when faced with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.05,0:53:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lawyer from your firm has…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.51,0:53:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Debbie！- …90seconds to cross this room
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.01,0:53:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,or the device attached to her chest will discharge and pierce her brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.35,0:53:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay。You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.14,0:53:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,She will find that the journey across this room is filled with danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.23,0:53:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,In order for her to make it，you will need to be there for her，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.95,0:53:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it is you who ultimately holds the key to her survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.20,0:53:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,When faced with death，will she have the skills to live？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.50,0:53:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the game begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.33,0:53:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Okay，listen！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.92,0:53:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jesus Christ！What the fuck is this？- Debbie！Debbie！Listen to me！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.72,0:53:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Debbie！Okay，Debbie，listen to me！Debbie！- What is this？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.80,0:53:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get me the fuck out of here！- Get through the maze
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.43,0:53:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,as fast as you can。Listen to me！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.01,0:53:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get me out of here！- Debbie！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。You've got to get through this maze as fast as you can！Go！Move now！Go now！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.11,0:54:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！You can make it！You can make it！You got to keep moving！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.74,0:54:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will，this is insane！I can't！- Go！You can make it！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.78,0:54:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！You can make it！You've got to keep moving！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.25,0:54:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute！I think I can help you up here！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.00,0:54:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe this will stop it！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.13,0:54:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.68,0:54:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it again！It worked！It worked！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.14,0:54:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do it again！It worked，it worked，it worked！- Okay！Ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.35,0:54:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes！- Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.53,0:54:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep moving！Don't stop！Keep going！Keep going！Keep going！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.08,0:55:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.42,0:55:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta keep going！Keep going！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.84,0:55:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep moving！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.34,0:55:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck，I can't！It's a fucking trap！There's no way out！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.81,0:55:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a fucking trap！I can't！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.69,0:55:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No，there's a ladder at the end！So just go under！I'll help you！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.49,0:55:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.16,0:55:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.80,0:55:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！Come on，Debbie，go！Climb！Climb！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.18,0:56:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on，you're almost there！You're almost there！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.86,0:56:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.40,0:56:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，look for a key.There's got to be a key！Look for a key！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.49,0:56:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.62,0:56:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.58,0:56:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's in you。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.87,0:56:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's fucking inside you！- Oh，fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.38,0:56:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Okay，I can do this。Wait！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.97,0:56:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the fuck are you doing？- I need that fucking key！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.49,0:56:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can get it！I can get it！I can get it！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.96,0:57:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！No！God！No！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.69,0:57:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Pamela.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.16,0:57:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，today you will experience the meaning of sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.45,0:57:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you will see the consequence for those who unjustly hurt others.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.16,0:57:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone's there。They're watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.73,0:58:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？Why would someone do this？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.44,0:58:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,To see how we respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.32,0:58:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,They want to know what decision we'll make.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.08,0:58:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's pull it。- No！We don't know what it does yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.71,0:58:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.30,0:58:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.68,0:58:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for coming in。- What'd you find？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.35,0:58:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- An abnormality in Strahm's fingerprint。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.64,0:58:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.48,0:58:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,See，the human fingerprint leaves an oily residue
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.73,0:58:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Depending on how long it's been exposed to the elements
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.11,0:58:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- it's highly susceptible to contamination。- So what's the problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.11,0:58:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we found trace amounts of Halomethane R- 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:59:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,She means Freon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.57,0:59:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Production of R- 12 ceased in 1994，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.04,0:59:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,So the question is，was the contaminant we found at the site already
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.79,0:59:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,or did Strahm bring it in with him？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.71,0:59:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're looking into the building's function
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.58,0:59:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,before it was abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.88,0:59:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.42,0:59:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did anything come off of the Seth Baxter tape？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.30,0:59:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，yeah，actually。We might be on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.47,0:59:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tape was in pretty rough shape when we found it，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.26,0:59:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we were able to authenticate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,The voice was intentionally distorted，but it didn't match John Kramer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.52,0:59:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's currently being analyzed。- For what？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.73,0:59:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we're trying to descramble the tape to find the original voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.86,0:59:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on with the tech right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.66,0:59:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You timing something？Your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.87,0:59:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I was before I got your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.00,0:59:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got it。This is our smoking gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.46,0:59:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lab's off- site。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.34,1:00:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're coming，right？- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.00,1:00:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You shut up！All you do is try to take over every situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know what the fuck you're talking about！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.68,1:00:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut the fuck up！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.26,1:00:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuck off！- Would you two just shut up already！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.68,1:00:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.06,1:00:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey！Who's in there？- Mr。Easton？Is that you？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.64,1:00:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，Shelby？Who's in there with you？- Mr。Easton！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.86,1:00:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are all here，sir，all 6。What the hell is going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.61,1:01:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody！We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.19,1:01:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What can you see？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.86,1:01:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't see anything。It's pitch dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.32,1:01:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's that sound？- I don't know，something we're chained to.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.54,1:01:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's spinning。Oh，God。- Get us out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.21,1:01:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You have to help us！- Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.62,1:01:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，get us out of here，Mr。E！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.30,1:01:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Easton！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.18,1:01:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Easton！You got to get us out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.56,1:01:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.19,1:01:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Easton！Mr。Easton！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.27,1:01:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！Please get us out of here！Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.07,1:01:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Easton，what is this？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.57,1:01:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.57,1:01:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,game？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，William。Before you are six of your most valuable associates，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.72,1:02:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,the ones who find errors in policies.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.72,1:02:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their findings result in over two- thirds
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.47,1:02:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,of all applications denied or prematurely terminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.60,1:02:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you must apply your analysis to them。And will you be able to find their errors？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.44,1:02:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six ride the carousel.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.70,1:02:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But only two can get off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.70,1:02:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The decision of which two survive falls upon you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.66,1:02:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,But remember.the mounted gun will continue to fire
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.67,1:02:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,until all six rounds are spent.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.75,1:02:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if no decision is made on your part，all six will perish.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.59,1:02:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.80,1:02:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,To offer the two reprieves，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.89,1:02:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,you must press both buttons at once in the box before you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.47,1:02:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，in doing so you'll give a sacrifice of your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.94,1:03:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two can live，four will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.86,1:03:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your decision's symbolized by the blood on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.41,1:03:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up！You've got to get us out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.25,1:03:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me！I am the one who should live.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.38,1:03:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.26,1:03:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！Mr。Easton！Mr。Easton！Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.18,1:03:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！Follow policy，Mr。Easton！Follow the policy！Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.31,1:03:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！Follow policy，Mr。Easton！Follow the policy！Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.24,1:03:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！- Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.49,1:03:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.99,1:03:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You always said we're only as strong as the weakest link！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.16,1:04:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest！You can't let me die！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.50,1:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck him！I'm healthy，sir。I'm healthy！Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.88,1:04:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Easton，come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.88,1:04:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I have two kids.You know them well.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.59,1:04:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，they can't get on without me！They need me！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.35,1:04:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.37,1:04:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you！Thank you！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.66,1:04:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fucking hell！- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.25,1:04:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why her？！You don't even know her！Mr。Easton！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.38,1:04:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to me，okay？My parents are sick，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.05,1:04:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They need me。I'm all they have，please！- You fucking liar！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.34,1:04:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Your parents hate you！They cut you off！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.76,1:04:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shut up！That's not true！- Fuck you，it is true。I sit next to you！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.01,1:04:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I… I'm pregnant。I'm pregnant！- No，she's not！She's lying！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.93,1:05:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's fucking lying！- Fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Easton，she is lying！- I'm pregnant！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's lying。- No！No，fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.94,1:05:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please！Please！Push the thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.75,1:05:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Push it！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.17,1:05:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.84,1:05:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.13,1:05:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Easton！My parents are loaded！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll give you whatever you want！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.39,1:05:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just say a number！- He's a thief！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.68,1:05:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's been stealing from the company for years！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.73,1:05:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's true！It's true！It's true！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.44,1:05:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thief！- Fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.23,1:05:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't listen to them！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.65,1:05:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't listen to them，Mr。E！- It's true！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.57,1:05:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ！Mr。Easton，come on！Mr。Easton…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.92,1:06:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Mr。Easton，listen to me carefully。I'm on your side，and I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.71,1:06:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But you cannot trust this bitch！- What？Fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.47,1:06:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You cannot believe her.She has already tried to lie！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.18,1:06:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,And she's just going to continue to do it！You know it！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.23,1:06:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's me，Josh！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.03,1:06:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please don't let me die！Please don't let me die！Don't kill me！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.62,1:06:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.18,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.35,1:07:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.94,1:07:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，well that's it，isn't it？！It's over！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.65,1:07:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You motherfucker！- Stop it…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.90,1:07:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You spineless，pussy- whipped MOTHERFUCKER！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.41,1:07:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's all it takes，huh？！A bitch says one thing and it's all over！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.25,1:07:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what，William？Your policy，it's bullshit！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.83,1:07:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fucking bullshit！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.59,1:07:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you listen to me，you son of a bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.97,1:07:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did everything for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.35,1:07:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me！When you're killing me，you look at me！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.78,1:08:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.33,1:08:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.91,1:08:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- Emily.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.77,1:08:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.52,1:08:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.28,1:08:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.45,1:08:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.16,1:08:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How's it going？- Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.50,1:08:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.63,1:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoever made this tape had access to
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.17,1:08:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,some very impressive audio filtration equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.92,1:09:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.72,1:09:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fortunately，we have some tricks of our own，here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.72,1:09:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can turn his algorithm upside- down and let us hear what he really sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.10,1:09:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's hear what you got.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.27,1:09:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.65,1:09:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.36,1:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem a little preoccupied.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.95,1:09:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just anxious about the tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.75,1:09:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.67,1:09:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right now，you're feeling helpless。- You know，there are still a couple of things
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.63,1:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't quite wrap my head around。- Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.38,1:09:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like，I don't understand Strahm's motivation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.30,1:09:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was my partner for five years.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，we all knew he was a bit of a hothead
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.43,1:09:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I never saw any indication of psychotic behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.98,1:09:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't really tell when someone's so good on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.11,1:10:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.32,1:10:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hear that？- Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.24,1:10:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm getting there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.62,1:10:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。I thought you had something to show us.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.24,1:10:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just I never really thought of him being vengeful.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.37,1:10:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right now，you're feeling helpless。- You know？I mean，all the facts are there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.13,1:10:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But something doesn't sit right。- Listen。It's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right now，you're feeling… - You know，there is an alternative.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.18,1:10:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's say that Strahm killed Seth Baxter
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.27,1:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,specifically to set you up as an accomplice to Jigsaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.31,1:10:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.69,1:10:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's a problem with that，though.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.15,1:10:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,On further analysis of Strahm's fingerprints，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.23,1:10:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,it was found that the uric acid levels in the eccrine gland residue
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.78,1:10:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,were inconsistent for an individual with an active epidermal metabolism.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.41,1:10:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,In other words？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.29,1:10:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,In other words，when he left his fingerprints on the latest victim，
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.25,1:10:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Strahm was already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.67,1:11:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right now，you're feeling helpless。- There it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.42,1:11:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right now，you're feeling helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.15,1:11:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who else knows about me？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.70,1:11:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who else fucking knows about me？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.00,1:11:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everyone。- You lie。You're fucking lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.75,1:14:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I found something you'll want to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.54,1:14:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was at the location where John died.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.55,1:14:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does it mean anything to you？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.01,1:14:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.10,1:14:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get as far away from the sprinkler head as possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.64,1:14:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't know what it does！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.93,1:14:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna just sit here and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.73,1:14:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to make a decision！Don't you understand？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.88,1:15:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。You can pull it。I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.88,1:15:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you，too。Get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.10,1:15:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。You don't know what it does
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.57,1:15:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On three，I「II pull it。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.33,1:15:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,One，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.95,1:15:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,two，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.91,1:15:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,three！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.04,1:15:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.42,1:15:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't even work！It doesn't even fucking work！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.72,1:16:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.52,1:16:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any fucking sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.74,1:16:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I know what it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.17,1:16:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get used to me，'cause I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.26,1:16:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure about that？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.68,1:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amanda will fail you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.77,1:16:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.78,1:17:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Amanda，you were with Cecil the night Jill lost Gideon.」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.29,1:17:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.33,1:17:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What the fuck are you doing？Go。Go。- I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.58,1:17:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you mean，you don't know？- She's been good to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.46,1:17:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been good to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.59,1:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know… - Please，please，go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.97,1:17:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You drive me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.26,1:17:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，you fucking pussy！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.56,1:17:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cecil！No！- Listen to me！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.86,1:17:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「You killed their child.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.03,1:17:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「You know it and I know it，so do exactly as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.54,1:17:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Kill Lynn Denlon or I will tell John what you did.」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.42,1:17:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,She doesn't deserve to go free！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.21,1:18:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amanda，Lynn is more important than you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.68,1:18:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lynn！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.96,1:18:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I made it。I made it。I made it！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.68,1:18:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you fail，you will never see your family again.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.69,1:19:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here？- Will！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.11,1:19:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pamela！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.94,1:19:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know it's your birthday.I'm going to make it up to you，I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.24,1:19:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you really standing up your sister for work？I'm your only family.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.45,1:19:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you all right？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.91,1:19:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let her go！I mean it！I won！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.21,1:19:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I followed your fucking rules！Now you let her go！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.84,1:19:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.63,1:19:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've just given me a death sentence.I mean，who's going to cover me now？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.18,1:19:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just killed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.18,1:19:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.81,1:19:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the man that killed my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.54,1:20:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Tara。My apologies for exposing you and your son to this kind of treatment.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.17,1:20:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can assure you，it is not without reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.72,1:20:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man before you just made the sacrifices to save the life of a loved one.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.14,1:20:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,However，when given the opportunity to save your husband's life，
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,he chose not to.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.48,1:20:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you will be given the power to save a life.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.61,1:20:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you grant this man the opportunity to continue living？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.53,1:20:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or will you dispense the same death sentence
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.12,1:20:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,he issued your husband？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.99,1:20:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Live or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.70,1:20:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.38,1:20:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not my game.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.18,1:20:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm leaving you a box today，and its contents are of grave importance.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.48,1:21:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Tuck，what's in the box？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.42,1:21:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.55,1:21:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have mercy，please！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.51,1:21:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he show mercy when my husband was suffering？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.35,1:21:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,John left you five envelopes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.56,1:21:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sixth one was for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.78,1:21:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is John's will.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.33,1:22:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to watch this horror！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.29,1:22:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He had no choice！- He always had a choice！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.54,1:22:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The reason I am doing this isn't because I can't forgive you
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.80,1:22:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,for what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.47,1:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The reason I'm doing this
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.80,1:22:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,is because I couldn't forgive myself for what you might do to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.10,1:22:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，no。Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.69,1:22:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You will never kill again。- Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.82,1:22:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.90,1:22:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.03,1:22:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.87,1:22:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please。Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.41,1:22:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't。I can't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.17,1:22:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.34,1:22:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，Brent！- You killed my father，you motherfucker！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.51,1:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you burn in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.79,1:23:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- John Kramer。- William Easton.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.72,1:23:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.90,1:23:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Those are the rules，Harold。- You've just given me a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.94,1:23:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，in a sense，you choose who lives or dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.91,1:24:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.62,1:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's policy，John。It's policy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.17,1:24:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think it's the living who will have ultimate judgment over you，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.88,1:24:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,because the dead will have no claim over your soul，
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.06,1:24:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you may be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.36,1:24:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,So when's your test，Detective？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.91,1:24:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't need one。- Oh，yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.21,1:24:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know why you're here，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.09,1:25:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know if you have what it takes to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.01,1:25:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You feel you now have control，don't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.68,1:25:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think you will walk away untested.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you like how brutality feels，Mark？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.16,1:25:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm only carrying out John's final request.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.91,1:25:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want a chance？I'll give you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.92,1:31:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.26,1:31:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.40,1:31:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't trust the one who saves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.85,1:31:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't trust the one who saves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱迪！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱迪！醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要动！听我说！ - 这是哪儿啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不管怎样都别站起来！ - 这咋的了这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么一回事？ - 别动！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位好，我想玩个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.00,0:02:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们头上的机关，是一种象征，象征着无良放贷者 桎梏贷款者的罪行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,明知他们的经济状况，你们仍发放贷款
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,硬逼借款者偿还高额利息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这两个食肉者，今天将成为献肉者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们献出一定份量的肉块
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,面前天秤，自由之门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,人数有限，两人争先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,通关代价：终极天罚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,切割砍剁，牺牲鲜肉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,面前仪器，传送献祭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟内
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,重量比对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,重者获胜，轻者失败
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,败者下场，穿脑而亡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生是死，自己选择
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋事在我，成事在人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会坐以待毙，婊子！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:06:00.78,Title,0,0,0,0,,《电锯惊魂6》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，斯特拉姆探员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学会相信我了么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过，如果选择不进去，那你就将长眠于此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将人间蒸发，生不见人，死不见尸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的黑锅，就由你来替我背着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,做出抉择吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个之前就存在的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,您没有事先通知保险公司
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿亲爱的，好的，可是，非常非常抱歉 不用喊我回家吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,单位有事，要见我的律师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙好估计很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道今天是你的生日，我会补的，放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额…刚才说到哪了？ - 说到你的证词
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么担心，黛比
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那种菜B律师面前，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说漏嘴的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为公司首席律师，你要是搞砸了，我也会跟着挨板子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢，你的证词，准备得怎样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉…顶你条粉肠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得哈罗德·阿贝特先生的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,威总，凯西·帕特森找您，一号线
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她留言，阿蒂嫂，我这周会打给她的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有空的话…你继续
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如对方律师问起来，你怎么回答？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.39,0:09:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会这么回复：
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为这家公司客户索赔部的副主管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,审查每份到期的保单是我的工作职责
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说那天阿贝特先生就坐在你现在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个位子上和我争论
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.11,0:09:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我就是搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们公司付了10多年的医保费
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.03,0:09:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，哈罗德，但问题是：在审查过程中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现你没有写明你以前的一项状况
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况？哪有什么状况？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这份报告上说，你曾动过一次口腔手术，去除了下巴囊肿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…简直荒谬！我得的是心脏病！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和30年前的口腔手术有个鸟关系？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何类型的口腔手术都会留下疤痕组织
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,疤痕会引起牙龈疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也该清楚：牙龈疾病会引发心脏病
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道么…你是在杀人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个挨千刀的杀人犯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.15,0:10:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷每月付保费花了10年的钱，连感冒都没得过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在真闹大病了，却只换来一纸否决？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爷要养家糊口！ - 我是按规矩办事，哈罗德
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，这都是你自己造成的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这代价我怎么担得起？你等于判了我死刑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个白眼狼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有家人，他发飙我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是谁让这家伙当初隐瞒实情呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额…等一下，威廉 - 咋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他是故意的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,评估他的意图不是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责是核对其索赔申请书的准确性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,社会对我们这行总是有偏见，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:11:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是，有几个人知道我们每年能帮助数百万人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.87,0:11:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,转危为安？有几个人知道我们每年将几百万美金 捐献给慈善机构？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有谁知道我们赞助过多少免费诊所？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 证词要简短，威廉，要有内涵 - “今天在遗嘱检验裁判所，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…史上最臭名昭著的连环杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.29,0:11:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·克莱默的资产，被依法分配
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中大部分是他生前拥有的房地产集团产权， 不过在本台记者的调查下…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱弱地问一句，是谁发现那申请书里的漏洞的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手下六人工作组，绰号“疯狗队”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.39,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,单据里一出现错误，他们立刻就能搜查出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,威总，他们在会议室等您
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天如何啊，伙计们？ - 很好很强大！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.78,0:11:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥，这位慢性病客户有两处漏洞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小样儿整天赖在他医生家里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我寻思咱大概可以省下20万
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们的终结者又出击了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去开会，几个钟头后回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,气色不错啊，老汉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了生命，哪位愿意献出最重的人肉祭品？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定权在于你们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会坐以待毙，婊子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场被FBI接管了，他们催你赶紧来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,老埃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你也会来干这种脏活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼图案现场发现指纹，我就特地过来瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,磅秤那边也有几处相同的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 验证过没？ - 恩，全部与小斯的指纹吻合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,得知电锯门盯上他和小皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该意识到这点的，可没想到事情会成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然是小斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家都震精了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过…有件事他还被蒙在鼓里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳塞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍大队长 - 皮瑞兹？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的决定，霍警官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.75,0:13:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,电锯门另有神秘门徒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在没查到是谁之前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要确保我部下的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你把全世界人民都耍了？ - 非常时期我选择保密
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还有多少事瞒着我？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们了解到，先前地产蒙骗案那5个人，小斯都认识
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是埃长官找到的那五个受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么会认识？ - 小斯和我曾调查过火灾那案子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那其实是起纵火案，五人都有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但由于我们唯一的证人失踪，最终无法提出对五人的指控
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.94,0:14:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能小斯不肯放过他们，所以就设置了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.65,0:14:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场惨烈的五人自相残杀游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话是什么意思？他成神雕大侠了么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么称呼都行，总之一定要找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望能和警方并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先前忽悠我说她死了，现在又要拉我做事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，霍警官，我们已经开诚布公了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.34,0:14:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始，双方信息同步更新，和谐了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍大队，简单采访您一会儿行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉·詹金斯，“拼图名记”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是实话实说罢了，霍大队
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近是不是在写那篇？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是能发表有关的正式声明
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会更荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把事实真相曲解成诱人的故事，不负责任
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次见到你很高兴，失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于约翰·克莱默，我手上有你想不到的猛料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.17,0:15:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？说来听听
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱默留给他老婆一个盒子作为遗产，这事你知道不？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许知道也许不知道，你是怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗嘱检验法院，这是公开记录，老百姓只要想知道就可以问到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊，那么你到底想干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉儿·塔克.帮个忙，让我找她谈谈，我保证今后不再哗众取宠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛？这事日后再说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得被绑架到那里的过程么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥都记不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一睁开眼就…是他干的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼图杀人狂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.01,0:16:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是你自己把手砍下来的么？ - 对，是我自己砍自己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但都是他逼我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为，我和爱迪做了错事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…我们害死了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在教训我们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你吸取教训了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.92,0:16:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你把眼睛睁大点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好瞧瞧我的胳膊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我吸取教训了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的胳膊！！说啊！我该吸取什么样的教训！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:17:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请你冷静 - 你回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊？丁丁宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这名字真好听，老公 - 哇哦，哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来想取「斯嘉丽」.但是咱家宝宝是男孩嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让爸爸看看镜头装不装得下咱一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，抱紧，靠近点，笑一笑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拍个合家欢 - 嘿，吉丁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福的一家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸妈妈爱你，儿子，在等你出来哦 - 我们爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看这盘录像带的时候，吉儿，我已经不在人世了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.65,0:17:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天留了个宝盒给你，里面的东西至关重要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，我现在不在家，有事请留言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔克女士，你好，又是我，帕梅拉·詹金斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问您一些有关您前夫的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否赏脸一起吃顿午饭或者咖啡什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于约翰·克莱默，我发现了一些有趣的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗？警官
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到这盘带子，有人一定以为一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得可以掌控局势了是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为不经过考验就太平了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张是以前那些死者身上的拼图
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.69,0:19:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那张是最近一次的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是一样的么？ - 是啊，一开始我们也这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.99,0:19:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对比拼图印记，最近这次的是用一种锯齿缘刀切割而成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那以前的呢？ - 以前的则是由某种近乎完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,高质量手术刀切出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来斯特拉姆用的刀不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩，不过这线索引起了我们的注意，我们对所有拼图印记做两相比较
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现只有一名死者身上的拼图与其纹路一致
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是塞斯·巴克斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个杀你妹妹的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们光凭照片就能看出割印记用的刀不一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能，但我能.塞斯的尸体，是我解剖的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上所有拼图案的尸体，都是我解剖的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.41,0:20:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,解剖帝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在割肉游戏现场没有找到录像带，所以我们在找塞斯的那盘带子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找来组撒？ - 我在想，既然拼图印记有可能是山寨的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么录像带也有可能是盗版的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是斯特拉姆？ - 是啊，有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果查出录像里是小斯的声音那就证据确凿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以正式颁布全国通缉令
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.23,0:20:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，吉儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.23,0:20:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可那不是我们所开的方… - 我得病了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我！看着我！- 简，简，没事的，好吗？淡定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么急着见我？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划不如变化
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 游戏今晚开始 - 咋的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有人知道了宝箱的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 这个你甭管
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要明白一点：从现在开始，这场游戏我做主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰可不是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把信封交出来，我这可不是在求你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今儿起，我单飞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂.我只是在了结约翰最后的遗愿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,老头已经死了，电锯门完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 介寺谁？- 未竟的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.19,0:22:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,事成之后，你我各安天命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 45分钟 - 是，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了！求求你！- 我们得等医生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你松开！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,美沙酮（戒毒用品，类似吗啡）只是个幌子，它治标不治本
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.26,0:22:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一种更有效的救人方式
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.10,0:22:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人，他们还会继续伤害你令你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是吸毒者，约翰，戒毒需要过程
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许依赖是人的一种本性
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.23,0:22:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这些人，吉儿，这些每天在这进进出出的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在利用你，戒的不是毒，是寂寞.逃避牢狱之灾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.41,0:22:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸食吗啡成瘾，你管这叫“戒毒”？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.16,0:22:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒毒不是那么简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,做伸手党却很简单，吉儿！醒醒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.75,0:23:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些自毁人生的人对生命没有丝毫的尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人只有到生死攸关的时刻，
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,才真正懂得人生价值
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把能证明其有效的证据带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿曼达？ - 好啊，吉儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.46,0:23:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾跟我说，她迷失了灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，她就在这
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.43,0:23:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她接受了洗礼，脱胎换骨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再浑噩，对重生满怀感激
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.23,0:24:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，确实行之有效，门主救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是危言耸听，装神弄鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.88,0:24:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但种种迹象告诉我们麻烦事又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.39,0:24:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管警方已确认拼图杀人狂约翰克莱默已死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.48,0:24:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而就在上周，可怕的事实表明：拼图杀人游戏再度发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.19,0:24:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶犯杀人的手法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,与拼图杀人狂极为相似
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.53,0:24:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼图杀人狂已死，但虐杀却仍在继续
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克，你还在不？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.00,0:25:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…日！我操！没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.01,0:26:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救你的，别怕，内家伙在哪？你怎么穿着马甲啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.30,0:26:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊，威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.81,0:26:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我地妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.31,0:26:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能想过你我何时会再次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.73,0:26:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在今天 - 不！！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.15,0:26:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来，你的概率公式理论左右了不少人的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,健康的人受益
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.53,0:27:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而生病的人却被不公平地拒绝接受保险
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的理论没有考虑到人的求生欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.29,0:27:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,“应该活命者”和“能够生存者”是两个截然不同的概念
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.13,0:27:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你的理论将要受到考验
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.09,0:27:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的四肢都被安装了引爆装置，你必须完成四个游戏任务
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.76,0:27:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你拒绝参与游戏，便四处爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,60分钟内必须完成全部任务，否则下场如此， 现在开始计时
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.66,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一路你并不孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.74,0:27:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同你害死别人的亲人那样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你时间用尽而又没能通关，
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.62,0:27:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也见不到你的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.05,0:28:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈？妈妈！醒醒，妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们介寺在哪？ - 母鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.14,0:28:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.40,0:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,额的个神呐…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.57,0:28:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的第一个考验
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你健康的体魄和军人出身为你取得了巨大成功
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.58,0:28:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,面前这个对手跟你大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.71,0:28:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,52年来，即便身患高血压和心脏病，
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.46,0:28:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人仍然吸烟过度
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.01,0:28:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他对自己的幸福人生很是满意
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这款游戏纠结于一种简单的元素：氧气
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏启动后，你每吸一口氧气
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.98,0:29:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰部巨钳都会夹紧，直到挤碎你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.49,0:29:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的胜利条件就是对方的失败
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.53,0:29:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想问你的是：面对死亡威胁，谁能生存下来？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.79,0:29:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生是死，威廉，做出你的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 决你妈！！ - 那扇贝到底是谁！！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.34,0:29:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏住呼吸！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！耶稣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！快点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.71,0:32:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.53,0:32:14.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（腐蚀性物品）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.26,0:32:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请救救我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.35,0:32:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我们啊！救命啊！救人呐！求求你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.35,0:32:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人救命啊！救命啊！有没有人？求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.02,0:32:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人呐！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.90,0:32:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,“生”？“死”？这什么玩意儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.78,0:32:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,连着内个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.62,0:32:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “H- F”？ 那是什么 - 是“万腐之王”氢氟酸
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人身上一沾这鬼东西，瞬间就被腐蚀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.68,0:32:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么办 - 拉这个扳手吧，咱要求“生”存，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.01,0:33:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那计时器又是什么？算什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.02,0:33:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，我都不知道为什么我们会在这！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.81,0:33:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这，是因为你爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.41,0:33:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹金斯小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.74,0:34:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了，很快就好，我们可以互利互助
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.70,0:34:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你觉得我俩可以互利互助？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.04,0:34:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一样你一定很想看到的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.00,0:34:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪找到的？ - 就在约翰死的那个肉厂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.30,0:34:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样，有帮助吧？ - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.93,0:34:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了，詹小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.64,0:34:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到什么就打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.11,0:35:29.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（那次派对）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.71,0:35:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你对这次派对的鼎力支持，威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.13,0:35:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,诊所的开办也要好好谢谢你们公司的赞助
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.67,0:35:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰·克莱默 - 威廉·伊斯盾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.21,0:35:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莱默？哦您是吉女士的丈夫吧？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.84,0:35:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.80,0:35:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似你们和我们算是同道中人呢，老翰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.97,0:35:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦是吗？怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们诊所试图预测病人的行为，我们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.44,0:35:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们找上我们是求一个依靠
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.86,0:35:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得仔细分析每个客户的可服务性
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.19,0:36:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是怎么分析的？ - 我们有一套公式
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.03,0:36:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来有点复杂，不过大体上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.74,0:36:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样算的：“按月支付能力”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.28,0:36:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘以“预期生命期限” 减去“患病概率”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,得出结果是正数的话就可以考虑为其办理医保
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.25,0:36:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这公式是谁发明的？ - 本盾
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.85,0:36:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此说来，在某种程度上，你能选择谁生谁死？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.84,0:36:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊不是，我是说我选择那些更有潜力活下去的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.97,0:36:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些健康长寿的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.89,0:36:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你无视了生存法则中最重要的一个人为因素
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.98,0:36:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么？ - 求生意志
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.15,0:36:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有当一个人面对生死关头，
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.57,0:36:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能判断出他是否有继续生存下去的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.19,0:37:34.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（抓住两头）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.09,0:37:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓你妹
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,日！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.45,0:38:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，威廉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.91,0:38:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在我背后平台上的，是你的两个部下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个，是文档管理员阿伦：一个无亲无故的健康小伙子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.04,0:38:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个，是中年女接线员阿蒂嫂，她有家族糖尿病史
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.51,0:38:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你的理论，年迈体弱的阿蒂嫂
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.43,0:38:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也该知道她的死亡会对其家人造成多大的打击
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.40,0:38:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而若选择救阿蒂嫂，那么阿伦将人间蒸发，消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人可以出这屋，选择权在你手上
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.24,0:38:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要救其中一个，就必须牺牲另一个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.08,0:38:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你所看到的，这种情况远比你面对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些血会弄污你的手的投保者棘手得多
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.46,0:39:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏开始
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.05,0:39:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！别走！等下！不！我不会那么做的！我不会那么做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.65,0:39:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,威总！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.40,0:39:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,介揍寺僧活！那不是我的本意！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.37,0:39:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放手的！我不放手！！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.99,0:39:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不松手！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.25,0:39:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下来！！ - 救救我…求你！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 不！不！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.99,0:40:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呜…谢谢…谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿蒂嫂，想办法逃出去吧，我还得赶路，你自己小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.91,0:41:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这酸液泼铁栏杆会怎样？能腐蚀掉铁栏杆，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.83,0:41:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,能，可是我们怎么泼？用手盛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.71,0:41:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在看什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.84,0:41:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道…这镜子后面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.26,0:42:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 是谁在镜子后面监视我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.68,0:42:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.90,0:42:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要这么做！！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.23,0:42:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人救命啊！求你了！请救救我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.75,0:42:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，帕梅拉，你为了自身利益曲解真相
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.21,0:42:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,耸人听闻，恶意诋毁我的生活…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.66,0:43:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是 - 是我，埃里克森
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.16,0:43:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到了塞斯·巴克斯特的带子 - 是嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.42,0:43:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事想跟你讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.34,0:43:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？ - 还是当面谈比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.22,0:43:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.32,0:43:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.66,0:43:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往前走几步就到 - 唔该
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.18,0:44:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套捆绑蒂莫西的机器是我的大爱，我取名为“人体扭转机”
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,临时抱佛脚？我早说过他搞不好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.57,0:44:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要切换齿轮转速
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.20,0:44:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得更改齿轮油以降低摩擦力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.54,0:44:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看给你配台起重机算了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.88,0:44:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小样儿该减肥了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.30,0:44:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪的机关可别再弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.55,0:44:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次想修改要先通知我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.93,0:44:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有几个“下次”？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.76,0:44:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间需要几次，我们就玩几次
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那毕竟是个活生生的人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.57,0:45:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就那么崇尚暴力吗？马克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.24,0:45:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们打开天窗说亮话吧，你我都是施虐狂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.60,0:45:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候轮到你玩游戏啊？警官 - 我不需要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.73,0:45:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦？是吗？ - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.07,0:45:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为，我不会像某人那样不把生命当回事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.61,0:45:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这方面你还处于菜鸟级别
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.78,0:45:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对生命了解多少？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.00,0:45:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得习惯我唠叨，因为我会一直在这陪门主
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.63,0:46:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,认真你就输了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.93,0:46:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候不早了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.31,0:46:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,您还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.94,0:46:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该去医院把戴伦医生带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.15,0:46:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨遵师旨，这就去办
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.47,0:46:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去快回
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.86,0:47:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来干什么？ - 约翰，停手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.74,0:47:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别再干了 - 我向你保证
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.79,0:47:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切都结束
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.92,0:47:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保你全身而退
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,时辰一到，你便知晓
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.86,0:48:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,操
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.35,0:48:38.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（最终决定）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.45,0:48:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跟你谈谈，威廉，是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.50,0:48:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到一套很有可能治好我癌症的疗法
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.55,0:48:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我申请的医保理赔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.80,0:48:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,却全部遭拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.14,0:48:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想当面来跟你解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.93,0:48:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看能不能帮我这个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.19,0:49:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我职责所在，你说吧，老翰 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.86,0:49:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是位挪威医生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.69,0:49:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的基因治疗技术成功率达到了30- 40%
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.37,0:49:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把名为“自杀式细胞”的基因注入癌变肿瘤细胞中
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.83,0:49:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,能使细胞对抗癌药物更敏感，然后就可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.25,0:49:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩，我听说过这种“基因治癌”
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.59,0:49:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，这位医生正开展一项新试验
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.71,0:49:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在找新的试验对象
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.34,0:49:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得我是最佳人选
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.55,0:49:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老翰，要是你的主治医师哥登医生觉得你是最佳人选的话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.64,0:49:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他早就治好你了 - 切！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.14,0:49:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥登医生确实是个专家，但他专的不是脑瘤而是钱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.64,0:49:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个自我主义者
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.35,0:49:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在我病床边没一会工夫就开门走了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.48,0:49:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰，别怪我说话直，像你这么大岁数得癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.20,0:49:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想治愈恐怕没有可行性…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.03,0:49:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等会，等会，什么叫做可行性？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.03,0:50:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你通过哪位数学大师的计算方法得出这事没有可行性？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.00,0:50:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是国家政策，老翰，是政策
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.21,0:50:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跳出体制去做那种公认的无效治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.79,0:50:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就肯定会因为违反政策
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.84,0:50:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而被拒绝理赔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.02,0:50:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗，在东方的天朝
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.98,0:50:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们身体健康的时候要付医生钱
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.69,0:50:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而得病则不用支付
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.70,0:50:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以基本上那儿的人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.45,0:50:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是“按需付费”
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.00,0:50:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们美国却正好相反
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.54,0:50:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些所谓的政客，每天说着千篇一律的空话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么“医疗对策应由医生和病人来判定
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.97,0:51:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是由政府来决定”
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.26,0:51:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,得，现在我才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.89,0:51:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来都不是由这三者决定
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.06,0:51:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是他妈的保险公司
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.61,0:51:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,食人鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.57,0:51:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,老翰，听我说，如果你非要这么做，于你自己不利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.37,0:51:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且随之而来的花销将是惊人的天文数字
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.74,0:51:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我提钱，我不差钱
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.75,0:51:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是原则问题
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.75,0:51:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉，我们谈的是我的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.51,0:51:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你忘了吗？ - 那么吉儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.55,0:51:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去挪威谁来照顾她？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.14,0:51:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事用不着你为我操心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.64,0:51:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得的癌症既致命又不能用手术治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话从你嘴里不知道说几遍了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.56,0:51:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算治疗起效果了，最终癌魔还是会回归
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是一场永远也打不赢的仗！ - 这次的借口更圆滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.15,0:52:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上就是这是一种最最陈腐的思想！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有活人才能对你终审
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.08,0:52:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而死人是不会有怨言的是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.05,0:52:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,侬搞错特乐！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.61,0:52:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.29,0:52:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，威廉，已经认识到你理论中的错误了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.62,0:52:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你还没见过面对生死关头
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.42,0:52:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种人会达到的境界
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.05,0:53:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你单位里的那位律师
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.51,0:53:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黛比！ - 必须在90秒时间内穿越这间游戏室
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.01,0:53:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则，安装在她胸前的机关启动后将射爆她的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.35,0:53:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕，没事的！会没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.14,0:53:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越过程中她会遇到重重危险
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.23,0:53:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了帮助她通过此关，你也必须到达指定地点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.95,0:53:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你就是决定其能否生存下去的最大因素
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.20,0:53:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对死亡，她拥有原地复活的技能吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.50,0:53:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏开始
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.33,0:53:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，黛比，淡定啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.92,0:53:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你娘里个脚！这什么玩意儿！ - 黛比！黛比！听我说！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.72,0:53:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黛比！没事的，听我说！黛比！ - 这什么啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.80,0:53:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快放老娘出去！ - 尽快穿越这个迷宫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.43,0:53:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说，尽快穿过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.01,0:53:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快放我出去！！ - 黛比！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.06,0:53:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要以最快速度穿过这个迷宫！听见没！快去吧！快啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.11,0:54:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！你能行的！你能行的！一直往前走！上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.74,0:54:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威廉！这太疯狂了！我不敢！ - 加油！你一定可以的！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.78,0:54:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊！你可以的！动起来！别停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.05,0:54:17.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（替她解围）
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.25,0:54:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持一会！我来帮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.00,0:54:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能这样可以停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.13,0:54:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.68,0:54:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来啊！有效果了！这招有用！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.14,0:54:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再来！这个有用！这个好！ - 好！准备好没！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.35,0:54:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了！ - 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.53,0:54:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续冲，别停下！继续冲！继续冲！继续冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.08,0:55:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别歇着！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.42,0:55:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续冲啊！继续往前！冲啊！冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.84,0:55:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续冲！冲冲冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.34,0:55:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲你娘里个脚啊！妈的是个陷阱！我过不去！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.81,0:55:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！这是个陷阱！我过不去！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.69,0:55:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不！前面有个梯子！走到那下边！我帮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.49,0:55:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好没？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.16,0:55:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.80,0:55:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊！加油啊，黛比，上啊！爬上来！爬上来！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.18,0:56:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！加油！就快到了！就快到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.86,0:56:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.40,0:56:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，快找钥匙！这里应该有把钥匙！找钥匙！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.49,0:56:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.62,0:56:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.58,0:56:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你！ - 纳尼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.87,0:56:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗日的在你肚子里！ - 我操！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.38,0:56:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，好吧，我来取，你干吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.97,0:56:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这臭娘们儿作死啊！ - 老娘要的是钥匙！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.49,0:56:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会取的！我会取出来的！我会取出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.96,0:57:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天那！不！！天那！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.69,0:57:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，帕梅拉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.16,0:57:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天，你将体会到“牺牲”的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.45,0:57:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,目睹那些害人虫的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.16,0:57:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.16,0:57:52.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动它）
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.52,0:58:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有人在那边在监视咱们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.73,0:58:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？这是为什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.44,0:58:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想看我们的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.32,0:58:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想知道我们会做什么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.08,0:58:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们推手闸吧 - 不行！我们还不知道会发生什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.58,0:58:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太冒险了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.71,0:58:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.30,0:58:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.68,0:58:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来了啊，辛苦 - 发现什么线索？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.35,0:58:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关于小斯指纹的一个疑点 - 是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.64,0:58:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.48,0:58:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人体的指纹会留有污渍
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.73,0:58:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,沾有何种残渣，取决于在何种
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.11,0:58:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外部环境中，暴露了多长时间 - 那么有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.11,0:58:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在小斯的指纹中发现了“制冷剂R- 12”
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:59:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是“氟利昂”
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.57,0:59:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,1994年以来国家规定停止使用制冷剂R- 12，
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.04,0:59:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以问题是： 氟利昂是案发现场原本就存在的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.79,0:59:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是小斯带过去的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.71,0:59:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在深入调查那幢房子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.58,0:59:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,废弃之前的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.88,0:59:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,接个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.42,0:59:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞斯·巴克斯特的录像带有没查出来什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.30,0:59:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，对，我估摸着快好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.47,0:59:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞斯的那盘带子很旧了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.26,0:59:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还是可以进行分析
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,带中声音被刻意做得很混沌，但已确定和老头的声音不匹配
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.52,0:59:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 技术组正在进行识别 - 识别什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.73,0:59:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,声纹识别，将变声还原成原声
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.86,0:59:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老埃正在跟技术组的人联系
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.66,0:59:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你约了其他事么？你的表…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.87,0:59:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，没有，来这之前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.00,0:59:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有信儿了！这下证据确凿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.46,0:59:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,技术组说结果快出来了，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.34,1:00:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也一块去对吧？ - 当然
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.00,1:00:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可拉倒吧！你每次就知道充大头！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞎吵吵什么玩意儿！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.68,1:00:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈再说一个？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.26,1:00:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚犊子！ - 你们俩都把嘴给我闭上行不！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.68,1:00:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.06,1:00:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！谁在里面！ - 盾哥？是你吗盾哥？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.64,1:00:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我，是西尔比吗？你和谁在一起？ - 盾哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.86,1:00:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们6个都在这，哥，这是怎么一回事？？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.61,1:01:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在，我们需要你的帮助！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.19,1:01:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看见什么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.86,1:01:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥也没见着啊，这儿黑忽忽的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.32,1:01:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 内是什么声音？ - 不道啊，好像是金属的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.54,1:01:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么我们在转悠？ - 快放我们出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.21,1:01:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快来救我们！ - 求你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.62,1:01:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！盾哥！救我们出去！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.30,1:01:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.18,1:01:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！你要救我们出去的啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.56,1:01:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我地妈！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.19,1:01:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！盾哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.27,1:01:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,求您救我们出去！求求你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.07,1:01:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥，这到底怎么回事？！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.57,1:01:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是场游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.57,1:01:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏？什么鸡吧游戏？！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.42,1:02:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，威廉，面前这六位是你最得力的干将
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.72,1:02:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,“找漏洞六人小组”
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.72,1:02:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们钻的空子导致三分之二的索赔申请
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.47,1:02:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,或最终驳回，或过早中止
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.60,1:02:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你对他们进行分析了，找出他们这些人的“漏洞”
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.44,1:02:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,六人骑木马
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.70,1:02:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只许二人下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.70,1:02:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟选哪个？由你来选择
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.66,1:02:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,规则第一项
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.67,1:02:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,六轮开六枪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.75,1:02:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动须趁早，团灭不得鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.59,1:02:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？啥玩意儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.80,1:02:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,救人先推手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.89,1:02:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,盒中按电钮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.47,1:02:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,若为自由故，两手皆抽搐
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.94,1:03:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,二人生，四人死
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.86,1:03:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲜血即标尺
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.41,1:03:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！别愣着啊！侬要救阿拉册七的呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.25,1:03:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我吧！我是该下马的那一个！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.38,1:03:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧槽…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.80,1:03:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,草泥马！！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.26,1:03:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你！盾哥！求求你！盾哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.18,1:03:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！盾爷！救我啊！！快按那按钮！！救我！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.31,1:03:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！盾爷！救我啊！！快按那按钮！！救我！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.24,1:03:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！ - 我的天那！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.49,1:03:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意你说！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.99,1:03:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！你不是经常说“百密必有一洞”么！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.16,1:04:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找的漏洞最多！不能让我死！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.50,1:04:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,死去！我最健康！我身体倍儿棒！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.88,1:04:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！快啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.88,1:04:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有两个孩子！您见过的！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.59,1:04:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是死了，他们怎么办！孩子们需要我！！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.35,1:04:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我日！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.37,1:04:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢…谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.66,1:04:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操你个蛋！ - 谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.25,1:04:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛选她！你根本不了解她！盾哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.38,1:04:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说好么？我父母都有病…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.05,1:04:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要靠我照顾，他们只能靠我了！ - 别搁那装人了！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.34,1:04:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你爹妈恨你！早和你断绝关系了！ - 纳尼？！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.76,1:04:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉倒吧！装什么玩意儿装！ - 装你妈逼，是真的！你这人怎么这样！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.01,1:04:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我…我怀孕了，我怀孕了！ - 扯你个鸟淡！她在扯淡！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.93,1:05:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是个大忽悠！盾爷，别信她鬼扯！ - 操你！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.64,1:05:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 盾哥，她在骗你！ - 我真的怀孕了！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她撒谎！ - 没有！妈的，真没有！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.94,1:05:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，快点，求你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.75,1:05:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快按啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.17,1:05:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.84,1:05:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈个B！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.13,1:05:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾哥！我家里钱多多！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.68,1:05:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你救我，想要多少都给你！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.39,1:05:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说个数！ - 他是个小偷！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.68,1:05:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年不知道偷了公司多少钱！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.73,1:05:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的！是真的！是真的！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.44,1:05:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小偷！ - 草泥马！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.23,1:05:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别信他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.65,1:05:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别听他们的，盾哥！ - 是真的！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.57,1:05:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊，盾哥！快按啊！盾哥！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.92,1:06:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾爷，听我说！我对你一片忠心！我来帮你选哪个！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.71,1:06:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要相信这个婊子！ - 嘛玩意儿？！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.47,1:06:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在骗你！别信她！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.18,1:06:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她过去骗你，现在骗你，将来还会骗你的！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.23,1:06:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我啊，我是约什
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.03,1:06:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不！求你了！别让我死！别杀我！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.62,1:06:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,操！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.18,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛祖啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.35,1:07:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.94,1:07:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊，原来是这么回事！这就结束了是吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.65,1:07:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这王八蛋！ - 不要…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.90,1:07:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这见色忘义的大烧饼！我操你妈个B！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.41,1:07:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么着了是吧！这2个骚货瞎吹都信！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.25,1:07:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗！屎盾！你的那些理论，都是狗屎！！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.83,1:07:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是大便！！！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.59,1:07:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个逼养给劳资听着
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.97,1:07:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳资为你做牛做马！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.35,1:07:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬起头来！！敢做不敢当么！！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.78,1:08:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.33,1:08:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.91,1:08:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你… - 爱米粒…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.77,1:08:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.52,1:08:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.28,1:08:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.45,1:08:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.16,1:08:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进展如何？ - 挺顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.50,1:08:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.63,1:08:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这盘录像带的制作者使用的是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.17,1:08:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一套极其高端的音频绿坝设备
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.92,1:09:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.72,1:09:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好我们有相关对策
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.72,1:09:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以倒置他的程序，如此逐步解出原声
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.10,1:09:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们听听当前破解出的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.27,1:09:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.65,1:09:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.36,1:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似有点心神不宁？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.95,1:09:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是急着想听到声音
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.75,1:09:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.67,1:09:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感到很无助吧 - 晓得伐，我还有很多事情
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.63,1:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没整明白 - 感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.38,1:09:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如，小斯的动机是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.30,1:09:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和他搭档5年了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道他是个急性子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.43,1:09:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是从他身上看不出任何变态行为的迹象
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.98,1:09:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎豹不堪骑，人心隔肚皮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.11,1:10:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…无助
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.32,1:10:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听见没？ - 感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.24,1:10:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.62,1:10:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，我就知道你一定行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.24,1:10:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想过他是报复心这么重的人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.37,1:10:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感到很无助吧 - 我的意思是，所有事实摆在这证明一点：
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.13,1:10:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事情有点不大对劲 - 听！很接近了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在感到… - 你看有没有这种可能性
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.18,1:10:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小斯杀塞斯·巴克斯特是为了嫁祸给你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.27,1:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们误以为你是老头的新门徒
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.31,1:10:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这可能
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.69,1:10:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，这里有个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.15,1:10:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过对小斯指纹的进一步分析
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.23,1:10:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现其尿酸水平
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.78,1:10:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,与一个拥有正常硬膜代谢的人不相符
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.41,1:10:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,言下之意？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.29,1:10:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说，小斯留下那些指纹之前
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.25,1:10:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就已经死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.67,1:11:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在，感到很无助吧 - 出来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.42,1:11:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，感到很无助吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.15,1:11:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁知道这事！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.70,1:11:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说！还有谁！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.00,1:11:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人尽皆知！ - 你这骗子！你这个该死的大骗子！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.75,1:14:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一样你一定很想看到的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.54,1:14:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在约翰死的那个肉厂
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.55,1:14:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样，有帮助吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.01,1:14:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.10,1:14:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,离那玩意儿远点！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.64,1:14:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没弄清楚状况
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.93,1:14:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能光这么坐着，要做点什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.73,1:14:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要做个决定！您明不明啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.88,1:15:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你推吧，妈妈爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.88,1:15:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱您，退后
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.10,1:15:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！你们不知道会发生什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.57,1:15:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数到三，我就推 - 行
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.33,1:15:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.95,1:15:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,二，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.91,1:15:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,三！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.04,1:15:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.42,1:15:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么拉了没效果？？为什么拉了没用！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.72,1:16:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的这算什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.52,1:16:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能够啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.74,1:16:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道怎么用了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.17,1:16:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得习惯我在这唠叨，因为我哪也不会去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.26,1:16:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真这么认为么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.68,1:16:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达会辜负你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.77,1:16:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拭目以待
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.78,1:17:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,“阿曼达，吉儿流产那晚你和西塞在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.29,1:17:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.33,1:17:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还墨迹什么玩意儿？去啊！快去！ - 我不知道我…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.58,1:17:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么玩意儿你不知道？ - 她对我们挺好的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.46,1:17:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你不好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.59,1:17:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道… - 求你了，求求你，去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.97,1:17:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯了你
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.26,1:17:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去啊！没用的东西！快点！快点！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.56,1:17:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 西塞！不要！ - 听我说！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.86,1:17:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,“是你害死了他们的孩子”
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.03,1:17:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,“这事你知，我也知，所以你要按我说的去做”
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.54,1:17:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,“杀了莲恩·戴伦，不然我就把真相告诉门主”
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.42,1:17:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这贱货根本不配活命！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.21,1:18:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达，莲医生比你想像得要重要
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.68,1:18:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,莲恩！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.96,1:18:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了！我做到了！我通关了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.68,1:18:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则，你将再也见不到你的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.69,1:19:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在这干嘛？ - 威廉！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.11,1:19:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕梅拉！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.94,1:19:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道今个是你生日，我会补的，放心
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.24,1:19:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那份工作和你唯一的妹妹到底哪个重要？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.45,1:19:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 恩
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.91,1:19:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放她走！我通关了！我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.21,1:19:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那狗P规则我都遵守了，放她出去！！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.84,1:19:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这挨千刀的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.63,1:19:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这代价我怎么担得起？你等于判了我死刑
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.18,1:19:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,白眼狼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.18,1:19:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，咱们走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.81,1:19:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是杀我爸爸的凶手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.54,1:20:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，塔拉，很抱歉把你和你儿子卷进这款游戏中
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.17,1:20:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里边是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.72,1:20:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男人进来之前为救他人，牺牲自我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.14,1:20:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而，他原本有机会救你的丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他没有
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.48,1:20:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我给你一个权力
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.61,1:20:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,来决定一个人的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.53,1:20:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是愿意给仇人改过自新的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.12,1:20:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是选择像当初仇人对你丈夫那样，宣判他的死刑？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.99,1:20:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是生，是死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.70,1:20:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定权在于你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.38,1:20:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这不是我的游戏…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.18,1:20:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留了个宝箱给你，里面的东西至关重要
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.48,1:21:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔克夫人，里面是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.42,1:21:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了，求你原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.55,1:21:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你，发发慈悲吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.51,1:21:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫遭受病魔折磨的时候他的慈悲在哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.35,1:21:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰留给你五个信封
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.56,1:21:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但第六个是给我的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.78,1:21:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的遗愿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.33,1:22:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,观看这次恐惧！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.29,1:22:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没办法… - 他当然有办法！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.54,1:22:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我非得这么做？不是因为我不能原谅
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.80,1:22:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我家所做的罪行
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.47,1:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是因为
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.80,1:22:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能忍受像你这种人在外头胡作非为！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.10,1:22:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…千万不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.69,1:22:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你再也害不了人了！ - 求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.82,1:22:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.90,1:22:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.03,1:22:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.87,1:22:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！求求你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.41,1:22:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不成…我下不了手…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.17,1:22:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.34,1:22:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，布伦特！ - 你杀了我爸，你个小逼养！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.51,1:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱去吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.79,1:23:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏结束
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰·克莱默 - 威廉·伊斯盾
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.72,1:23:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.90,1:23:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是按规矩办事，哈罗德 - 你等于判了我死刑
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.94,1:23:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说来在某种程度上你能选择谁生谁死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.91,1:24:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.62,1:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是国家政策，老翰，是政策
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.17,1:24:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有活人才能对你终审
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.88,1:24:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而死人是没有怨言的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.06,1:24:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.36,1:24:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候玩游戏啊？警官
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.91,1:24:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不需要玩 - 哦？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.21,1:24:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该晓得为什么你会在这吧？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.09,1:25:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道你是否有资格活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.01,1:25:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得可以掌控局势了是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.68,1:25:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为不经过考验就太平了？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就那么崇尚暴力吗？马克
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.16,1:25:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在了结约翰最后的遗愿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.91,1:25:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要机会吗？我来给你一个机会
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.92,1:31:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.26,1:31:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.40,1:31:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信那个来救你的人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.85,1:31:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要相信那个来救你的人
